json", "paragraphs": ["両選手は12月11日に始まる興行で対戦するが、実際の試合は12日未明になると見られている。会場はカーディフのプリンシパリティ・スタジアムで、チケットは最高1万3128ポンド、最低88・50ポンドで販売された。英国出身のヘビー級対決はNetflixで世界配信される。", "約8万枚のチケットは金曜日正午に発売され、開始から数分で50万人以上がオンラインの待機列に並んだ。すぐに転売サイトにも出品が現れ、リングサイドのVIP席は7万3645ポンド、上層階の席は425ポンドの値が付けられた。", "試合前には短いライブ演奏が行われ、リングインは12日午前1時ごろに始まる予定である。スタジアムは午前3時30分まで開場される。"], "paragraphs_zh": ["两人将在12月11日开始的赛事上交手，但实际比赛预计要到12日凌晨。比赛地点是加的夫的普林西帕利蒂球场，门票最高13128英镑，最低88.50英镑。这场全英国重量级对决将在Netflix上向全球直播。", "约8万张票在周五中午开卖，几分钟内就有超过50万人在网上排队。很快转卖网站上就出现了票源，拳台边的VIP座位标价73645英镑，上层看台座位标价425英镑。", "赛前会有简短的现场音乐表演，拳手入场预计在12日凌晨1点左右开始，球场开放到凌晨3点半。主办方被宣传为沙特拳击大佬图尔基·阿拉尔希赫的The Ring和UFC总裁达纳·怀特的合作。"], "body": "両選手は12月11日に始まる興行で対戦するが、実際の試合は12日未明になると見られている。会場はカーディフのプリンシパリティ・スタジアムで、チケットは最高1万3128ポンド、最低88・50ポンドで販売された。英国出身のヘビー級対決はNetflixで世界配信される。\n\n約8万枚のチケットは金曜日正午に発売され、開始から数分で50万人以上がオンラインの待機列に並んだ。すぐに転売サイトにも出品が現れ、リングサイドのVIP席は7万3645ポンド、上層階の席は425ポンドの値が付けられた。\n\n試合前には短いライブ演奏が行われ、リングインは12日午前1時ごろに始まる予定である。スタジアムは午前3時30分まで開場される。", "body_zh": "两人将在12月11日开始的赛事上交手，但实际比赛预计要到12日凌晨。比赛地点是加的夫的普林西帕利蒂球场，门票最高13128英镑，最低88.50英镑。这场全英国重量级对决将在Netflix上向全球直播。\n\n约8万张票在周五中午开卖，几分钟内就有超过50万人在网上排队。很快转卖网站上就出现了票源，拳台边的VIP座位标价73645英镑，上层看台座位标价425英镑。\n\n赛前会有简短的现场音乐表演，拳手入场预计在12日凌晨1点左右开始，球场开放到凌晨3点半。主办方被宣传为沙特拳击大佬图尔基·阿拉尔希赫的The Ring和UFC总裁达纳·怀特的合作。", "text": "両選手は12月11日に始まる興行で対戦するが、実際の試合は12日未明になると見られている。会場はカーディフのプリンシパリティ・スタジアムで、チケットは最高1万3128ポンド、最低88・50ポンドで販売された。英国出身のヘビー級対決はNetflixで世界配信される。 約8万枚のチケットは金曜日正午に発売され、開始から数分で50万人以上がオンラインの待機列に並んだ。すぐに転売サイトにも出品が現れ、リングサイドのVIP席は7万3645ポンド、上層階の席は425ポンドの値が付けられた。 試合前には短いライブ演奏が行われ、リングインは12日午前1時ごろに始まる予定である。スタジアムは午前3時30分まで開場される。", "vocab": [], "title_original": "Fury-Joshua tickets priced up to £13,000 sell out in one hour", "summary_original": "Tickets for Tyson Fury and Anthony Joshua's fight at Cardiff's Principality Stadium sells out in just one hour.", "body_original": "Fury-Joshua tickets priced up to £13,000 sell out in one hour\nPublished\n9 October 2026\nTickets for Tyson Fury and Anthony Joshua's fight at Cardiff's Principality Stadium have sold out in just one hour.\nFury and Joshua will meet on a bill that begins on 11 December but they are not expected to fight until the early hours of 12 December.\nThe highest-priced tickets were available at £13,128, including booking fees, with the lowest at £88.50.\nThe all-British heavyweight contest, which will be broadcast globally on Netflix, was\nannounced in September\nand around 80,000 tickets went on sale at 12:00 BST on Friday.\nJust minutes after the tickets went on sale more than 500,000 people were waiting in the online queue.\nTickets quickly began emerging on resale websites, with ringside VIP seats being advertised for £73,645, while upper tier seats were available for £425.\nRingwalks are\nexpected to start around 01:00 GMT\non Saturday 12 December, following a short live music performance, and the stadium will remain open until 03:30.\nThe event is being promoted as a collaboration between Saudi boxing powerbroker Turki Alalshikh's The Ring and UFC chief Dana White.\nOrganisers are yet to confirm any of the undercard fights.\nWhat information do we collect from this quiz?\nJoshua, 36, and Fury, 38 - both former two-time world champions - signed contracts for the bout earlier this year, but the date and venue had yet to be confirmed.\nLondon's Wembley Stadium and New York's Madison Square Garden were the frontrunners to stage the fight, but both presented issues before Cardiff emerged as an alternative.\nThe Principality Stadium has hosted late-night boxing before, including Joe Calzaghe's fight with Mikkel Kessler in November 2007, which began at 01:00 GMT.\nRicky Hatton's victory over Kostya Tszyu at Manchester's MEN Arena in 2005 began at about 02:00 local time, allowing US broadcaster Showtime to show the fight on Saturday evening.\nJust 11 days ago, there was uncertainty over whether the fight would even take place due to a dispute over the role of UFC chief White in the promotion of the event.\nBroadcaster Netflix said Alalshikh's The Ring and White would collaborate to promote the event, but Joshua's promoter Eddie Hearn said his fighter's contract prevented White from having a promotional role.\nThe British rivals finally met at a news conference on 30 September to begin the build-up to one of the most anticipated fights in British history.\nFury and Joshua are reported to be sharing a purse worth close to $200m (£151m)\nRelated topics\nBoxing\nBoxing schedule and results 2026\nPublished\n1 day ago\nWatch every Born to Brawl episode\nPublished\n28 April 2024\nMore boxing from the BBC\nNotifications, social media and more with BBC Sport\nPublished\n28 August", "fetched_at": "2026-10-10T01:08:30.325164", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "両", "s": 0.125, "e": 0.388, "sm": 125, "em": 387, "cs": 0, "ce": 1, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "選手", "s": 0.4, "e": 0.812, "sm": 400, "em": 812, "cs": 1, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "は", "s": 0.825, "e": 1.012, "sm": 825, "em": 1012, "cs": 3, "ce": 4, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "12", "s": 1.05, "e": 1.508, "sm": 1050, "em": 1508, "cs": 4, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "月", "s": 1.508, "e": 1.738, "sm": 1508, "em": 1737, "cs": 6, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "11", "s": 1.75, "e": 2.217, "sm": 1750, "em": 2216, "cs": 7, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "日", "s": 2.217, "e": 2.45, "sm": 2216, "em": 2450, "cs": 9, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "に", "s": 2.462, "e": 2.55, "sm": 2462, "em": 2550, "cs": 10, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "始ま", "s": 2.562, "e": 2.975, "sm": 2562, "em": 2975, "cs": 11, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "る", "s": 2.987, "e": 3.137, "sm": 2987, "em": 3137, "cs": 13, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "興行", "s": 3.15, "e": 3.612, "sm": 3150, "em": 3612, "cs": 14, "ce": 16, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "で", "s": 3.625, "e": 3.725, "sm": 3625, "em": 3725, "cs": 16, "ce": 17, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "対戦", "s": 3.737, "e": 4.188, "sm": 3737, "em": 4187, "cs": 17, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "する", "s": 4.2, "e": 4.475, "sm": 4200, "em": 4475, "